{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "003S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$2$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-2-product-categories-over-C}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-2-product-fibred-categories}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a09c24ec2d25cd681716b94fac9200b9048bae113080f6001113641b30bad3cf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:83bfdff098011ed1239780a57627c936bd2863ae61ce1614bca808a73f57edac", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nThe <MATH_0002>-category of categories fibred in groupoids\nover <MATH_0003> has 2-fibre products, and they are described as in\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7eed0f963bbcc6a86c86d508b5ad3b1c48d797b8372256d9ea8cef4bd286f157", "unit_id": "tag:0041:statement"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "003S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-2-product-fibred-categories-over-C}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-2-product-categories-over-C}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-fibred-groupoids}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-fibre-2-fibre-product-categories-over-C}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-2-fibre-product-categories}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b15315ec3c2fa7b154c0d17c24b63d47f12b572ea3fa602a460510e1a685b882", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b488080c51d2cbaeb78cd4a6de391d85e1a2b23aca5620b9fa1f0db2a17d836c", "source_text": "By Lemma <REF_0001>\nthe fibre product as described in\nLemma <REF_0002> is a fibred category.\nHence it suffices to prove that the fibre categories are\ngroupoids, see Lemma <REF_0003>.\nBy Lemma <REF_0004>\nit is enough to show that the <MATH_0001>-fibre product of groupoids\nis a groupoid, which is clear (from the construction in\nLemma <REF_0005> for example).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b280f16e5a7cfaf3962d38bdf8ec89bc8793cf3bddfe82afb8608c72b4c0abe0", "unit_id": "tag:0041:proof"}
